    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n37878" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">prae-răpĭdus</span></b> , a,
		um, adj., <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b><i>very swift</i>, <i>very rapid</i>
			(post-Aug.). </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b>
			<b>Lit.</b>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">amnis,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Sen. Apoc. 7, 2, v. 11</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">celeritas,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">id. Q. N. 1, 1, 1</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">gurges,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Liv.
					29, 32, 9</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">fluminum celeritas,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Curt.
					9, 4, 15</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">fuga,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Sil.
					16, 563</span></i>
			.—</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>II.</b>
			<b>Trop.</b>, <i>very eager</i>, <i>very ardent</i>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">juvenis,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Sil.
					17, 180</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">fuga,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">id.
					16, 564</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">ira,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Sen. Ira, 1, 12, 5</span></i>
			.</div>
